(4781400, 690983, 54645, '<td valign="top">I like the textures. Seems a bit flat in that I''m having a hard time separating the foreground and background greens.</td>', 'I like the textures. Seems a bit flat in that I''m having a hard time separating the foreground and background greens.', '2008-06-23 10:53:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4781402, 691108, 54645, '<td valign="top">Maybe you''ll bump in to the other guy walking the line and you can live happily ever after! :) I like this one better. There are multiple lines, i.e. the ties, undergrowth, and tries, that are giving the main line context and depth.</td>', 'Maybe you''ll bump in to the other guy walking the line and you can live happily ever after! :) I like this one better. There are multiple lines, i.e. the ties, undergrowth, and tries, that are giving the main line context and depth.', '2008-06-23 10:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4781406, 691045, 54645, '<td valign="top">I think this image would benefit from more DOF and/or a longer exposure. The sky appears to be moving in the the same direction as the water, which gives the image a nice sense of movement</td>', 'I think this image would benefit from more DOF and/or a longer exposure. The sky appears to be moving in the the same direction as the water, which gives the image a nice sense of movement', '2008-06-23 11:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4781407, 690998, 54645, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective. Very good. 7</td>', 'Simple but effective. Very good. 7', '2008-06-23 11:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4781408, 690952, 54645, '<td valign="top">Water is exposed nicely, as is the memorial.</td>', 'Water is exposed nicely, as is the memorial.', '2008-06-23 11:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4781412, 690982, 54645, '<td valign="top">Flowers are nice.  As the road is tilted to the right, I feel like the trees on the left are somothering your subject. Seems like a small point but it''s destracting once my mind has latched on to it! I love the wildflowers. Their color is reflected in the sky. Good luck.</td>', 'Flowers are nice.  As the road is tilted to the right, I feel like the trees on the left are somothering your subject. Seems like a small point but it''s destracting once my mind has latched on to it! I love the wildflowers. Their color is reflected in the sky. Good luck.', '2008-06-23 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4781413, 690698, 63750, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colors.</td>', 'Nice composition and colors.', '2008-06-23 11:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4781414, 691108, 63750, '<td valign="top">Best of the rail lines because of the added interest. I wonder if a little "off" perfect diagonal might have looked a little better?</td>', 'Best of the rail lines because of the added interest. I wonder if a little "off" perfect diagonal might have looked a little better?', '2008-06-23 11:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
