(4782110, 690887, 66515, '<td valign="top">Oh! I saw this last night and liked it. Glad to see you''ve corrected the typo.</td>', 'Oh! I saw this last night and liked it. Glad to see you''ve corrected the typo.', '2008-06-23 19:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782111, 691065, 66515, '<td valign="top">Not a big fan of the borders. I''d like to see this use more space so we can see more detail.</td>', 'Not a big fan of the borders. I''d like to see this use more space so we can see more detail.', '2008-06-23 19:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782114, 690397, 66515, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love this one. Great drama in the sky, nice textures throughout particularly the sand. (Good sharpening without making the sand look like gravel). Interesting composition and the line in the sand works really well for the challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely love this one. Great drama in the sky, nice textures throughout particularly the sand. (Good sharpening without making the sand look like gravel). Interesting composition and the line in the sand works really well for the challenge.', '2008-06-23 19:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782117, 690445, 66515, '<td valign="top">A lot of artifacts from trying to remove the background. When you are trying to remove your background take your time and work at 100% with the full sized image.</td>', 'A lot of artifacts from trying to remove the background. When you are trying to remove your background take your time and work at 100% with the full sized image.', '2008-06-23 19:21:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782118, 691044, 66515, '<td valign="top">The rail works well as the "line" for the challenge. I like the shadow as it adds emphasis to the rail and creates an interesting wedge shape. Nice texture in the gravel. Is that a grain elevator in the distance? (nice to have something at that vanishing point)</td>', 'The rail works well as the "line" for the challenge. I like the shadow as it adds emphasis to the rail and creates an interesting wedge shape. Nice texture in the gravel. Is that a grain elevator in the distance? (nice to have something at that vanishing point)', '2008-06-23 19:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782120, 691042, 66515, '<td valign="top">A lot of clothes lines in this challenge. You''ve probably heard that before. This is one of the better ones. You''ve probably heard that too. :)<br/> <br/>Nice dramatic sky with interesting colors. The clothes themselves pic up the colors of the sky nicely. Great job!</td>', 'A lot of clothes lines in this challenge. You''ve probably heard that before. This is one of the better ones. You''ve probably heard that too. :) Nice dramatic sky with interesting colors. The clothes themselves pic up the colors of the sky nicely. Great job!', '2008-06-23 19:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782125, 690671, 66515, '<td valign="top">It would be interesting to see this with a blur of tail lights instead. The headlights just kinda blend in. <br/> <br/>Interesting detail alongside the road that I didn''t see the first time I viewed this shot. Nice take on the challenge and well executed.</td>', 'It would be interesting to see this with a blur of tail lights instead. The headlights just kinda blend in.  Interesting detail alongside the road that I didn''t see the first time I viewed this shot. Nice take on the challenge and well executed.', '2008-06-23 19:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782127, 689846, 66515, '<td valign="top">I didn''t notice the selective desat the first time I saw this. It works well to separate the mirror from the background. Sadly, your red light is currently green. Or at least the light behind you is... :)</td>', 'I didn''t notice the selective desat the first time I saw this. It works well to separate the mirror from the background. Sadly, your red light is currently green. Or at least the light behind you is... :)', '2008-06-23 19:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782130, 690597, 66515, '<td valign="top">A lot of lines in this and I imagine a few people may grump about that. I however, see the strong diagonal line as the primary element in the shot. <br/> <br/>Looks like a reflection and I find myself asking "Of what?" I''ll have to come back and see I guess. <br/> <br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'A lot of lines in this and I imagine a few people may grump about that. I however, see the strong diagonal line as the primary element in the shot.  Looks like a reflection and I find myself asking "Of what?" I''ll have to come back and see I guess.  Nicely done.', '2008-06-23 19:29:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782133, 690465, 83686, '<td valign="top">doesn''t fit the challenge description, "single" line, good shot though</td>', 'doesn''t fit the challenge description, "single" line, good shot though', '2008-06-23 19:31:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782134, 690597, 90829, '<td valign="top">Nice photo</td>', 'Nice photo', '2008-06-23 19:31:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782136, 690973, 66515, '<td valign="top">Really great shot but I wouldn''t say that this is a picture of a line. Its a landscape. Yes there is a line in the shot but pretty much every shot does. The goal in this challenge was to make it your subject. <br/> <br/>Beyond that...:<br/>Great reflections and a wonderful monotone appearance to the shot that works well. I like the subtle details captured in the water. A beautiful dramatic sky here. (I love well captured skies).</td>', 'Really great shot but I wouldn''t say that this is a picture of a line. Its a landscape. Yes there is a line in the shot but pretty much every shot does. The goal in this challenge was to make it your subject.  Beyond that...:Great reflections and a wonderful monotone appearance to the shot that works well. I like the subtle details captured in the water. A beautiful dramatic sky here. (I love well captured skies).', '2008-06-23 19:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782137, 690120, 83686, '<td valign="top">the background of this shot blends too much with the subject, good use of DoF but not enough contrast...</td>', 'the background of this shot blends too much with the subject, good use of DoF but not enough contrast...', '2008-06-23 19:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782142, 690699, 83686, '<td valign="top">single line is the subject? not here, looks like the horses are, good shot though</td>', 'single line is the subject? not here, looks like the horses are, good shot though', '2008-06-23 19:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782143, 691084, 65035, '<td valign="top">Very funky, the legs take it from potentially dull to something intriguing.</td>', 'Very funky, the legs take it from potentially dull to something intriguing.', '2008-06-23 19:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782145, 690952, 83686, '<td valign="top">single line is the subject....no, the shot is busy with other distractors like the water, buildings and trees. a different angle might have worked better</td>', 'single line is the subject....no, the shot is busy with other distractors like the water, buildings and trees. a different angle might have worked better', '2008-06-23 19:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782149, 690945, 65035, '<td valign="top">Noooooooo stay a-way from the light! Opps, sorry, shrek moment. Seriously, I really like this, there''s some odd patterning of the white on the rails and the white edge is just a tad hard. I''ll be interested to see how you did this, it''s a great idea and for the most part very well done.</td>', 'Noooooooo stay a-way from the light! Opps, sorry, shrek moment. Seriously, I really like this, there''s some odd patterning of the white on the rails and the white edge is just a tad hard. I''ll be interested to see how you did this, it''s a great idea and for the most part very well done.', '2008-06-23 19:40:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782150, 690891, 83686, '<td valign="top">the background blends too much with the subject, the selective DoF might have worked better if it was on the clothespin</td>', 'the background blends too much with the subject, the selective DoF might have worked better if it was on the clothespin', '2008-06-23 19:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782152, 690438, 83686, '<td valign="top">I think the subject doesn''t have enough "evil" on the right side, interesting idea though</td>', 'I think the subject doesn''t have enough "evil" on the right side, interesting idea though', '2008-06-23 19:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
