(4782192, 690747, 55956, '<td valign="top">Interesting image...who knows if this is the photograph  cited in the forum for the dsq...I don''t think that this is a statue or similar but more probably has been created with a long exposure and the paint with the light technique. The idea is great and if you don''t will dsq you well deserve the ribbon here.good luck.10</td>', 'Interesting image...who knows if this is the photograph  cited in the forum for the dsq...I don''t think that this is a statue or similar but more probably has been created with a long exposure and the paint with the light technique. The idea is great and if you don''t will dsq you well deserve the ribbon here.good luck.10', '2008-06-23 20:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
