(4782368, 690945, 24896, '<td valign="top">Sorry! The edit on this pic is rough! You can see all the dodge marks. Try a gradiant mask to a white background it will give you the effect your trying to get here with a MUCH better end result. And I think this is too tight of a frame to be considered a true vaishing point perspective. Not trying to offend here just trying to help. Let me know if you have questions, comments, or concerns. Good Luck. Scott</td>', 'Sorry! The edit on this pic is rough! You can see all the dodge marks. Try a gradiant mask to a white background it will give you the effect your trying to get here with a MUCH better end result. And I think this is too tight of a frame to be considered a true vaishing point perspective. Not trying to offend here just trying to help. Let me know if you have questions, comments, or concerns. Good Luck. Scott', '2008-06-23 23:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
