(4782898, 691085, 66384, '<td valign="top">For me, this is too many lines for a single line challenge. It is a nice image though.</td>', 'For me, this is too many lines for a single line challenge. It is a nice image though.', '2008-06-24 07:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782899, 691012, 66384, '<td valign="top">I see that she has chosen to walk a single line, but the image does not seemed to really have a single line as the subject. There are many lines in the image and the girl appears to be the primary focal point.</td>', 'I see that she has chosen to walk a single line, but the image does not seemed to really have a single line as the subject. There are many lines in the image and the girl appears to be the primary focal point.', '2008-06-24 07:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782900, 690888, 66384, '<td valign="top">The image appears too dark over all. I think more contrast could have been achieved in the b&amp;w conversion. Or it could have been brightened a bit with a levels adjustment. The day is obviously sunny, judging by the shadows.</td>', 'The image appears too dark over all. I think more contrast could have been achieved in the b&w conversion. Or it could have been brightened a bit with a levels adjustment. The day is obviously sunny, judging by the shadows.', '2008-06-24 07:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4782906, 691115, 66384, '<td valign="top">I really don''t understand what you were trying to achieve with this rotation. For this to work, I think it would have to be cropped more precisely, with all four corners of the image touching the edges of the frame, or at least equidistant from the edge. The cut of left corner is very distracting. As for the original line of eggs, I like it.</td>', 'I really don''t understand what you were trying to achieve with this rotation. For this to work, I think it would have to be cropped more precisely, with all four corners of the image touching the edges of the frame, or at least equidistant from the edge. The cut of left corner is very distracting. As for the original line of eggs, I like it.', '2008-06-24 08:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
