(4783014, 690535, 65234, '<td valign="top">Really nice image, but a bit of a stretch for the challenge IMO.  Mostly because I see the line of columns as background to the kids, who grab my eye immediately and look like they''re having a blast playing in that big space.</td>', 'Really nice image, but a bit of a stretch for the challenge IMO.  Mostly because I see the line of columns as background to the kids, who grab my eye immediately and look like they''re having a blast playing in that big space.', '2008-06-24 09:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783017, 690991, 65234, '<td valign="top">Much better than what I could get from one drawn line!  Nice lighting.</td>', 'Much better than what I could get from one drawn line!  Nice lighting.', '2008-06-24 09:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783019, 691082, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely minimalist.  Interesting to note the shadows actually have a little color in them.</td>', 'Nicely minimalist.  Interesting to note the shadows actually have a little color in them.', '2008-06-24 09:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783027, 690438, 65234, '<td valign="top">Impressive job on the editing.  I like the implication that light/good is less real, the imperfections polished away, no furrow of worry in the brow.  Really thought-provoking image.<br/> <br/>That said ... not sure it isn''t just a bit of a shoehorn.  I can just stretch my mind around the idea that the effect of the line is the subject instead of the physical line I see, so I''ll buy it.</td>', 'Impressive job on the editing.  I like the implication that light/good is less real, the imperfections polished away, no furrow of worry in the brow.  Really thought-provoking image. That said ... not sure it isn''t just a bit of a shoehorn.  I can just stretch my mind around the idea that the effect of the line is the subject instead of the physical line I see, so I''ll buy it.', '2008-06-24 10:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783031, 690939, 65234, '<td valign="top">I see multiple utility lines, parallel to each other and on the diagonal, which I like.  And the road, which is also a line and utilitarian.  It''s not entirely clear to me which is the subject.  If it''s the utility lines I think you needed a different angle with fewer other things in the shot (like straight up into the sky, for example), and/or a closer perspective so the lines took up more of the image.</td>', 'I see multiple utility lines, parallel to each other and on the diagonal, which I like.  And the road, which is also a line and utilitarian.  It''s not entirely clear to me which is the subject.  If it''s the utility lines I think you needed a different angle with fewer other things in the shot (like straight up into the sky, for example), and/or a closer perspective so the lines took up more of the image.', '2008-06-24 10:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783032, 691043, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very funky-looking plant.  I find it much more interesting than the line running past it.</td>', 'Very funky-looking plant.  I find it much more interesting than the line running past it.', '2008-06-24 10:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783038, 690984, 91776, '<td valign="top">a good idea for this challenge...</td>', 'a good idea for this challenge...', '2008-06-24 10:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783039, 690793, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nice line!  Soft, dreamy abstract and I love the curve of the line.  Color is a little too saturated for my taste.</td>', 'Very nice line!  Soft, dreamy abstract and I love the curve of the line.  Color is a little too saturated for my taste.', '2008-06-24 10:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783043, 691022, 65234, '<td valign="top">Simple composition; I like the placement of the line so it''s not on a 45 degree angle from corner to corner.  Would actually like to see more detail on the cable, maybe a closer crop?</td>', 'Simple composition; I like the placement of the line so it''s not on a 45 degree angle from corner to corner.  Would actually like to see more detail on the cable, maybe a closer crop?', '2008-06-24 10:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783044, 690886, 91776, '<td valign="top">good abstract, elegant</td>', 'good abstract, elegant', '2008-06-24 10:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783045, 690964, 65234, '<td valign="top">Aww, I haven''t been seeing many duckies lately!  Nice lineup.</td>', 'Aww, I haven''t been seeing many duckies lately!  Nice lineup.', '2008-06-24 10:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783062, 690965, 65234, '<td valign="top">A zipper changed her world?  Sorry, not getting this, and she''s clearly trying to convey something with her expression and hand gesture.  I''ll revisit this post-challenge.</td>', 'A zipper changed her world?  Sorry, not getting this, and she''s clearly trying to convey something with her expression and hand gesture.  I''ll revisit this post-challenge.', '2008-06-24 10:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783070, 690887, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice shiny line with some dimension to it.  I think I would prefer a perspective a little closer to the car so the line took up more of the image and the wheel well could be left out.</td>', 'Nice shiny line with some dimension to it.  I think I would prefer a perspective a little closer to the car so the line took up more of the image and the wheel well could be left out.', '2008-06-24 10:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783077, 690275, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Think I would like this better if the entire thing were in sharp focus.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Think I would like this better if the entire thing were in sharp focus.', '2008-06-24 10:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783082, 690920, 65234, '<td valign="top">Yikes, I think I''m back in the 70''s with all those colors!  And I may be on drugs ;-)  The DOF is a little dizzying, but fun.</td>', 'Yikes, I think I''m back in the 70''s with all those colors!  And I may be on drugs ;-)  The DOF is a little dizzying, but fun.', '2008-06-24 10:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783092, 690963, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective, the line leading to the water, and that one little sailboat out there.  For this challenge I think I''d crop out the gulls to keep the viewer''s eye on that line, bump up the contrast some, and convert to straight black and white (it''s close now and I don''t think the brown tones in the road add anything).</td>', 'I like the perspective, the line leading to the water, and that one little sailboat out there.  For this challenge I think I''d crop out the gulls to keep the viewer''s eye on that line, bump up the contrast some, and convert to straight black and white (it''s close now and I don''t think the brown tones in the road add anything).', '2008-06-24 10:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783101, 690378, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting gagdet.  I think for this challenge I might try some closer crops with just the heavily rusted piece, which would make place more emphasis on the "line" and its texture.  Also, the sky looks oversaturated a bit on my monitor.</td>', 'Interesting gagdet.  I think for this challenge I might try some closer crops with just the heavily rusted piece, which would make place more emphasis on the "line" and its texture.  Also, the sky looks oversaturated a bit on my monitor.', '2008-06-24 10:51:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783105, 691047, 65234, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty funny :-)  However did you find an apron-laden clothesline still in place from the 1950''s?</td>', 'That''s pretty funny :-)  However did you find an apron-laden clothesline still in place from the 1950''s?', '2008-06-24 10:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783107, 690960, 65234, '<td valign="top">Not a fan of the processing, sorry.</td>', 'Not a fan of the processing, sorry.', '2008-06-24 10:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783108, 690967, 65234, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  I like that there are reflections in the brown but not in the blue, leading me to wonder if the colors are not the only thing different about these liquids.  There''s a lot of tension in the line between them.</td>', 'Interesting.  I like that there are reflections in the brown but not in the blue, leading me to wonder if the colors are not the only thing different about these liquids.  There''s a lot of tension in the line between them.', '2008-06-24 10:57:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783110, 690959, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great perspective and composition for this.  Graffiti artists have been very busy here.</td>', 'Great perspective and composition for this.  Graffiti artists have been very busy here.', '2008-06-24 10:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783112, 690893, 65234, '<td valign="top">I like the concept and the tones.  I do wish the skyline had a bit more variation in height and shape.</td>', 'I like the concept and the tones.  I do wish the skyline had a bit more variation in height and shape.', '2008-06-24 10:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783114, 691067, 65234, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject and nice curves to your line.  I might have preferred more DOF so it was sharp inthe foreground, but that''s a relative nit.</td>', 'Excellent subject and nice curves to your line.  I might have preferred more DOF so it was sharp inthe foreground, but that''s a relative nit.', '2008-06-24 11:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783115, 690490, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ah, the construction colors of summer!  Not one of my favorite lines to encounter.</td>', 'Ah, the construction colors of summer!  Not one of my favorite lines to encounter.', '2008-06-24 11:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783116, 691023, 65234, '<td valign="top">Looks cool and inviting.</td>', 'Looks cool and inviting.', '2008-06-24 11:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783121, 691061, 65234, '<td valign="top">Where are all the people?!  Perspective is great.  I like the processing except for the sky being a bit oversaturated IMO.  You also have a dust spot in the upper left corner you could clone out (and a few others in the sky, now that I look closer).  Bit of a tossup in my mind as to whether this is more leading lines than the line as a subject but it''s a really nice image.</td>', 'Where are all the people?!  Perspective is great.  I like the processing except for the sky being a bit oversaturated IMO.  You also have a dust spot in the upper left corner you could clone out (and a few others in the sky, now that I look closer).  Bit of a tossup in my mind as to whether this is more leading lines than the line as a subject but it''s a really nice image.', '2008-06-24 11:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783124, 691033, 65234, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection!  In fact, I would like the shot a little better with the person cropped out altogether.  You lose the curve, I know, but it makes for a really interesting image IMO.  I like it as is; I would love it with the tighter crop.</td>', 'Love the reflection!  In fact, I would like the shot a little better with the person cropped out altogether.  You lose the curve, I know, but it makes for a really interesting image IMO.  I like it as is; I would love it with the tighter crop.', '2008-06-24 11:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783130, 690445, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and congrats on keeping the dog from eating the props, though there appear to be some crumbs near the rear leg.  Lighting looks a little odd to me with the multiple shadows from the dog and his/her head still relatively dark.  Since the treats are so contrasty I might just go for high key processing on this one.</td>', 'Nice idea and congrats on keeping the dog from eating the props, though there appear to be some crumbs near the rear leg.  Lighting looks a little odd to me with the multiple shadows from the dog and his/her head still relatively dark.  Since the treats are so contrasty I might just go for high key processing on this one.', '2008-06-24 11:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783133, 690882, 65234, '<td valign="top">A lovely image of a lovely peaceful place, but the contrail doesn''t appear to be the subject any more than the moon might be.</td>', 'A lovely image of a lovely peaceful place, but the contrail doesn''t appear to be the subject any more than the moon might be.', '2008-06-24 11:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783135, 691073, 65234, '<td valign="top">Amazing differences in sky color from top to bottom.  The blackness of the clouds is overwhelming, particularly against the blue parts of the sky.  If that''s from processing, I''d kind of like to see what it looked like without that, or with less of it.</td>', 'Amazing differences in sky color from top to bottom.  The blackness of the clouds is overwhelming, particularly against the blue parts of the sky.  If that''s from processing, I''d kind of like to see what it looked like without that, or with less of it.', '2008-06-24 11:23:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783136, 691064, 65234, '<td valign="top">Awesome :-)  Instantly makes me start imagining things!</td>', 'Awesome :-)  Instantly makes me start imagining things!', '2008-06-24 11:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783142, 690971, 65234, '<td valign="top">wonderful colors and shapes; I like this a lot.  But ... can''t say as either line appears to be the subject and I wouldn''t like this nearly as much if you cropped either one out.</td>', 'wonderful colors and shapes; I like this a lot.  But ... can''t say as either line appears to be the subject and I wouldn''t like this nearly as much if you cropped either one out.', '2008-06-24 11:37:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783146, 690440, 65234, '<td valign="top">Wow.  You really nailed this one!</td>', 'Wow.  You really nailed this one!', '2008-06-24 11:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783147, 691065, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I like his pattern and the bits of flower decorating him.</td>', 'Nice!  I like his pattern and the bits of flower decorating him.', '2008-06-24 11:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783149, 689510, 65234, '<td valign="top">Like the subject and composition; not a fan of the processing.</td>', 'Like the subject and composition; not a fan of the processing.', '2008-06-24 11:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783192, 690747, 57260, '<td valign="top">That''s very clever. How many takes did it take until the drawing was actually discernable? Only critique is that the background is a little busy and distracting.</td>', 'That''s very clever. How many takes did it take until the drawing was actually discernable? Only critique is that the background is a little busy and distracting.', '2008-06-24 12:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783342, 690218, 40718, '<td valign="top">tough one.  a great picture, but my eye is totally drawn to the water sweeping over the far walkway.  Gonna give this a middle of the road score to declare neutrality. 6</td>', 'tough one.  a great picture, but my eye is totally drawn to the water sweeping over the far walkway.  Gonna give this a middle of the road score to declare neutrality. 6', '2008-06-24 15:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783343, 690671, 90678, '<td valign="top">Great color and lighting.</td>', 'Great color and lighting.', '2008-06-24 15:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783345, 691088, 90678, '<td valign="top">Gerat idea, I really like the contrasting color.</td>', 'Gerat idea, I really like the contrasting color.', '2008-06-24 15:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783350, 691115, 90678, '<td valign="top">The overal focus seems soft.</td>', 'The overal focus seems soft.', '2008-06-24 15:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783352, 690671, 94963, '<td valign="top">looks good.</td>', 'looks good.', '2008-06-24 15:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783356, 691062, 90678, '<td valign="top">I find the DOF distracting.  I personally would like to have seen the rope sharp.</td>', 'I find the DOF distracting.  I personally would like to have seen the rope sharp.', '2008-06-24 15:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783363, 690076, 90678, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I think it would balance better with the 3rd clip either all the way in or not there.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I think it would balance better with the 3rd clip either all the way in or not there.', '2008-06-24 15:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783369, 690698, 79128, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2008-06-24 15:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783371, 690936, 90678, '<td valign="top">Great idea!  I really like the composition.</td>', 'Great idea!  I really like the composition.', '2008-06-24 15:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783389, 691037, 90829, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2008-06-24 15:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783423, 691108, 93762, '<td valign="top">Even the space between her legs and the trees in the background is perfect...amazing.</td>', 'Even the space between her legs and the trees in the background is perfect...amazing.', '2008-06-24 16:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783461, 690793, 65779, '<td valign="top">I really like this abstract - works nicely.</td>', 'I really like this abstract - works nicely.', '2008-06-24 16:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783463, 691042, 77192, '<td valign="top">Love this one. Great lighting and colours. Kudos to you for making it almost look like a movie poster (not sure why it makes me think of that, but it does)</td>', 'Love this one. Great lighting and colours. Kudos to you for making it almost look like a movie poster (not sure why it makes me think of that, but it does)', '2008-06-24 16:56:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783467, 690583, 77192, '<td valign="top">s midgen of oversharpening in the branches, but I love the mood of this shot.</td>', 's midgen of oversharpening in the branches, but I love the mood of this shot.', '2008-06-24 16:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783468, 690699, 65779, '<td valign="top">This is a double line I''d say...</td>', 'This is a double line I''d say...', '2008-06-24 16:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783469, 690693, 77192, '<td valign="top">the DOF is a bit too shallow I think in this shot. If it wasn''t for the title, I''d sort of wonder what you were getting at.</td>', 'the DOF is a bit too shallow I think in this shot. If it wasn''t for the title, I''d sort of wonder what you were getting at.', '2008-06-24 16:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783470, 690963, 65779, '<td valign="top">Is this a runway?  :-)</td>', 'Is this a runway?  :-)', '2008-06-24 16:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783471, 691073, 77192, '<td valign="top">perhaps a shoehorn for the challenge, but a GREAT shot anyways.</td>', 'perhaps a shoehorn for the challenge, but a GREAT shot anyways.', '2008-06-24 16:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783476, 691085, 77192, '<td valign="top">nice patterns, perhaps too many lines for this particular challenge though.</td>', 'nice patterns, perhaps too many lines for this particular challenge though.', '2008-06-24 17:01:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4783481, 690431, 65779, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting image. Good luck.</td>', 'This is an interesting image. Good luck.', '2008-06-24 17:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783487, 690879, 77192, '<td valign="top">lol for some reason this makes me think of a really old and awful joke:<br/> <br/>A piece of string walks into a bar, and the barman says "sorry, we don''t serve string in here". The string leaves, and ties himself in a knot before returning later. The barman says "I sure I spoke to you before. I can''t serve you. Aren''t you a piece of string?". The string replies "No, I''m a frayed knot."<br/> <br/>Lol sorry to make you groan with that. Great shot btw. I''m trying to work out which way you up you must have shot it?</td>', 'lol for some reason this makes me think of a really old and awful joke: A piece of string walks into a bar, and the barman says "sorry, we don''t serve string in here". The string leaves, and ties himself in a knot before returning later. The barman says "I sure I spoke to you before. I can''t serve you. Aren''t you a piece of string?". The string replies "No, I''m a frayed knot." Lol sorry to make you groan with that. Great shot btw. I''m trying to work out which way you up you must have shot it?', '2008-06-24 17:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783488, 690800, 65779, '<td valign="top">Something went wrong with the colour processing in the middle of this one.</td>', 'Something went wrong with the colour processing in the middle of this one.', '2008-06-24 17:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783489, 690980, 77192, '<td valign="top">Hmmm, is that its real title? ;-)</td>', 'Hmmm, is that its real title? ;-)', '2008-06-24 17:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783491, 691062, 77192, '<td valign="top">not really in focus, I''m afraid</td>', 'not really in focus, I''m afraid', '2008-06-24 17:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783506, 691092, 27373, '<td valign="top">I would''ve liked to have seen some motion in the club, that would''ve helped "sell" the shot as a series of just one ball rolling to the cup.</td>', 'I would''ve liked to have seen some motion in the club, that would''ve helped "sell" the shot as a series of just one ball rolling to the cup.', '2008-06-24 17:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783569, 691108, 89398, '<td valign="top">Über diagonal.</td>', 'Über diagonal.', '2008-06-24 17:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783647, 691107, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. I think it might be even more dramatic if you dodged the front of the house and roof a bit. The driveway leading to the house is reflecting the bright light, and it would seem natural for the house to reflect it a bit more too. Great capture.</td>', 'I like this a lot. I think it might be even more dramatic if you dodged the front of the house and roof a bit. The driveway leading to the house is reflecting the bright light, and it would seem natural for the house to reflect it a bit more too. Great capture.', '2008-06-24 18:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783650, 690952, 66384, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and colors.</td>', 'Beautiful light and colors.', '2008-06-24 18:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783654, 690625, 66384, '<td valign="top">Love the frog and the image. The line is there, but doesn''t seem to be the main subject.</td>', 'Love the frog and the image. The line is there, but doesn''t seem to be the main subject.', '2008-06-24 19:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783657, 690886, 66384, '<td valign="top">Lovely image and an effective line. I would like it even better if the noise was reduced.</td>', 'Lovely image and an effective line. I would like it even better if the noise was reduced.', '2008-06-24 19:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783660, 690397, 66384, '<td valign="top">Really like this one.</td>', 'Really like this one.', '2008-06-24 19:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783665, 690934, 66384, '<td valign="top">Delightful.</td>', 'Delightful.', '2008-06-24 19:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783666, 691036, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the motion blur.</td>', 'I like the motion blur.', '2008-06-24 19:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783672, 690497, 66384, '<td valign="top">Great fun!</td>', 'Great fun!', '2008-06-24 19:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783677, 691084, 66384, '<td valign="top">The red shoes are a nice touch.</td>', 'The red shoes are a nice touch.', '2008-06-24 19:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783678, 690120, 66384, '<td valign="top">I like the muted colors and the very shallow DOF. Really makes the knot more of the subject than the line, but I still like it a lot.</td>', 'I like the muted colors and the very shallow DOF. Really makes the knot more of the subject than the line, but I still like it a lot.', '2008-06-24 19:20:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783679, 690753, 66384, '<td valign="top">In my opinion the boy is the main subject of this image. I like it though.</td>', 'In my opinion the boy is the main subject of this image. I like it though.', '2008-06-24 19:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783686, 690380, 66384, '<td valign="top">This makes me smile. I love the colors against the pure white background. The smiley face on the leader, and the little one in the back looking at the camera really make this a winner.<br/> <br/>eta: Great picture for a kids room. Be sure to put the print up for sale.</td>', 'This makes me smile. I love the colors against the pure white background. The smiley face on the leader, and the little one in the back looking at the camera really make this a winner. eta: Great picture for a kids room. Be sure to put the print up for sale.', '2008-06-24 19:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783689, 690971, 66384, '<td valign="top">Exquisite design! Looks like a classic.</td>', 'Exquisite design! Looks like a classic.', '2008-06-24 19:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783869, 690380, 76598, '<td valign="top">cute, colorful, good contrast (where did you get so many cats???)</td>', 'cute, colorful, good contrast (where did you get so many cats???)', '2008-06-24 22:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783923, 690497, 26464, '<td valign="top">this is brilliant and should take blue.</td>', 'this is brilliant and should take blue.', '2008-06-24 22:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783926, 690970, 26464, '<td valign="top">wonderful use of depth of field</td>', 'wonderful use of depth of field', '2008-06-24 22:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783927, 691042, 26464, '<td valign="top">well done, top 10</td>', 'well done, top 10', '2008-06-24 22:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783928, 690984, 26464, '<td valign="top">good concept. 7</td>', 'good concept. 7', '2008-06-24 22:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
