(4783932, 690959, 26464, '<td valign="top">i love the controlled chaos here</td>', 'i love the controlled chaos here', '2008-06-24 22:45:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4783937, 690882, 82985, '<td valign="top">hmmm...  the very good Single Line that I immediately saw in this image was the shoreline.  However, since the title directs my attention to the contrail, and defines it as bad, I don''t see this the same way any longer.  May have been better, since advanced editing rules applied, to remove the contrail rather than curse it, and , in general, to avoid directing the viewer to the least attractive element in the image....</td>', 'hmmm...  the very good Single Line that I immediately saw in this image was the shoreline.  However, since the title directs my attention to the contrail, and defines it as bad, I don''t see this the same way any longer.  May have been better, since advanced editing rules applied, to remove the contrail rather than curse it, and , in general, to avoid directing the viewer to the least attractive element in the image....', '2008-06-24 22:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
