(4788698, 690963, 81362, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, but for this challenge, I like it better scrolled up to hide the birds -- making the dashed line the main focus, contasting with the two horizontal lines. Enjoyable balance of tones.</td>', 'Interesting image, but for this challenge, I like it better scrolled up to hide the birds -- making the dashed line the main focus, contasting with the two horizontal lines. Enjoyable balance of tones.', '2008-06-28 00:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788703, 691107, 24454, '<td valign="top">WOW!!!!!!   This is a BEAUTIFUL lightning shot.  So often awesome lightning shots have dark, ugly "stuff" on the ground, but the scene itself is serene and beautiful.  The lighting just adds an off-the-chart WOW factor!   Surely from what I''ve seen, this one will win!  It certainly has as high a vote as I can give it :)  Good luck!</td>', 'WOW!!!!!!   This is a BEAUTIFUL lightning shot.  So often awesome lightning shots have dark, ugly "stuff" on the ground, but the scene itself is serene and beautiful.  The lighting just adds an off-the-chart WOW factor!   Surely from what I''ve seen, this one will win!  It certainly has as high a vote as I can give it :)  Good luck!', '2008-06-28 00:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4788709, 690825, 24454, '<td valign="top">Irene?   It look like your brilliant, clean, masterful, ribbon-winning work!  If not Irene, consider yourself very complimented on a flawless "Irene-type" photo :)</td>', 'Irene?   It look like your brilliant, clean, masterful, ribbon-winning work!  If not Irene, consider yourself very complimented on a flawless "Irene-type" photo :)', '2008-06-28 00:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
