(4789061, 691072, 34192, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and the elements of the image.  The haziness/gaussian blur give it a kind of watercolor effect that I''m not sure adds to the image.  Strange editing mishap in the roof of the house. An alternate edit might be to try Feivel''s gothic glow - it would really punch the colors and add to the lushness present in the scene. 6</td>', 'Like the composition and the elements of the image.  The haziness/gaussian blur give it a kind of watercolor effect that I''m not sure adds to the image.  Strange editing mishap in the roof of the house. An alternate edit might be to try Feivel''s gothic glow - it would really punch the colors and add to the lushness present in the scene. 6', '2008-06-28 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4789066, 690762, 34192, '<td valign="top">You are probably not scoring well with this but, as a piece of art, I find it extremely intriguing.  Takes me back to near the beginning of modern art in the US, to a study of the human form.  I love the tones and thing they work tremendously well to add to the shape.  Not sure what this is an image of (not that it matters) but I''m looking forward to your notes.  Love the fitting title. 9</td>', 'You are probably not scoring well with this but, as a piece of art, I find it extremely intriguing.  Takes me back to near the beginning of modern art in the US, to a study of the human form.  I love the tones and thing they work tremendously well to add to the shape.  Not sure what this is an image of (not that it matters) but I''m looking forward to your notes.  Love the fitting title. 9', '2008-06-28 11:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
