(4808553, 690990, 30982, '<td valign="top">It meets the challenge to my eyes, Stephen.  I think there are a lot of very picky voters in some of these challenges.  The them, a line must be perfectly straight.  I do think the technical aspects probably contributed to a lower score.  The runners need to be a little crisper in focus, the contrast a little stronger.  But don''t give up!</td>', 'It meets the challenge to my eyes, Stephen.  I think there are a lot of very picky voters in some of these challenges.  The them, a line must be perfectly straight.  I do think the technical aspects probably contributed to a lower score.  The runners need to be a little crisper in focus, the contrast a little stronger.  But don''t give up!', '2008-07-07 04:04:56.000000', NULL, 0),
